{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>You and Aaron</b> — and above in Ki Tissa, Aaron did not assist in that counting, because through him the calf was made, on account of which they required a counting — therefore he did not count them. The princes: begins with Elitzur and ends with Pagiel, on account of 'that formed them as the apple of His eye' — and through the cloud."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:57.806602338Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}